# The bare-domain (no www) -> www redirect that used to live here as two
# absolute-URL lines has been REMOVED, not just reformatted. Workers
# Static Assets' _redirects parser only accepts relative source/destination
# URLs (https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/)
# -- an absolute host-based rule like "https://tlsfoundations.com/* ->
# https://www.tlsfoundations.com/:splat" fails validation at deploy time
# ("Invalid _redirects configuration: Line 12: Only relative URLs are
# allowed"), and Cloudflare started hard-enforcing that and blocking every
# deploy on this branch. A host-based redirect has to be a zone-level
# Redirect Rule / Bulk Redirect in the Cloudflare dashboard instead --
# see the comment in wrangler.jsonc and the note left for Tim.
